# Skill Application Map (all 9 mandatory)

| Skill | Where applied |
|---|---|
| frontend-design | Token re-skin, glass layer only on page surfaces, `--dk-elev-*` system, radii ∈ {8,12,pill} |
| Human-Centric UX | Section 5: empty/loading/error/populated for every direction; hover/click/focus/drag feedback |
| Impeccable | Typography scale (3-tier contrast), anti-patterns: no wall-of-mono, no arbitrary radii, no decorative-only gradients |
| Motion — Bring the UI Alive | Liveliness levels: A=L1 Composed, B=L1+ (functional cursor), C=L2 Responsive (pointer-reactive glow). Reduced-motion kills all ambient. |
| Design Taste System | Knobs: DESIGN_VARIANCE high (3 distinct surfaces), MOTION_INTENSITY low→med, DENSITY high (B) / medium (A/C). Anti-repetition: each direction has a unique accent channel. |
| UI UX Pro Max | Developer-tool density + precision for B; premium dark chrome for C |
| frontend-external-infra | Anti-slop checklist (Section 6), re-skin rule, no new deps |
| ui-and-charts | Chart styling: grid stroke, tooltip glass, bar fills per direction |
| taste-skill | Variance/motion/density knobs enforced per direction; one signal hue per surface |

