# Section 1 — Design Direction Summary

**A · SIGNAL (L1 Composed)** — A machined instrument slab. Solid, opaque zinc with a top-lit sheen; the category color exists *only* as a precision "signal wire" strip that bleeds a faint 12px gradient into the panel. Depth comes from recessed stat wells and layered solid fills — never glass. Mood: OBS Studio / hardware dash. Distinct because it is the *only* direction with zero transparency and zero ambient motion.

**B · TERMINAL CHIC (L1 + functional cursor)** — A flat IDE panel. The monolith is broken by a 3-tier contrast scale (labels pushed to `#3f3f46`, titles in Inter, data in mono) and full-bleed hairline dividers. Category color is a 2px left "prompt rail" + a blinking block cursor. No shadows, no scale-on-hover — precision over flourish. Distinct because it is the *only* direction with no elevation and no rounded corners above 8px.

**C · NEON GLASS (L2 Responsive)** — Premium layered glass. The weak `bg-zinc-900/40` is replaced with a 2-stop top-lit glass gradient over `blur(24px)`, giving real surface definition. The artificial 4s opacity pulse is replaced by a *pointer-reactive* glow that follows the cursor (static 12s micro-drift on touch, fully static under reduced motion). Distinct because it is the *only* direction with transform-on-hover and colored shadow.

---

# Section 2 — Complete Token Sets

All three scopes inherit `:root` `--dk-*`/`--ws-*`. Direction properties are compositions only. `--cat` is the category hex from `CATEGORY_ACCENT`, injected inline (matches existing `${color}10` code pattern).

## A · SIGNAL — scope `.proto-signal` / `[data-proto="a"]`
```css
--sig-surface: linear-gradient(180deg, #1b1b1f 0%, #141417 100%); /* functional: top-lit machined slab */
--sig-border: var(--ws-border);               /* rgb(39 39 42 / .6) */
--sig-border-hover: var(--ws-border-strong);  /* rgb(63 63 70 / .6) */
--sig-elev: var(--dk-elev-1);
--sig-elev-hover: var(--dk-elev-2);
--sig-sheen: var(--dk-sheen);                 /* inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05) */
--sig-radius-card: 0.75rem;   /* 12px */
--sig-radius-inner: 0.5rem;   /* 8px */
--sig-well-bg: #0d0d10;
--sig-well-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.65), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.02);
--sig-bar-h: 2px;
--sig-bar-bleed: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cat) 0%, transparent 100%); /* 12px tall, 12%→0 */
--sig-text: var(--dk-text-primary);
--sig-text-dim: var(--dk-text-secondary);
--sig-text-faint: var(--dk-text-muted);
--sig-ease: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
--sig-dur: 180ms;
```

## B · TERMINAL CHIC — scope `.proto-terminal` / `[data-proto="b"]`
```css
--term-surface: #0e0e11;            /* flat solid, +2 steps above page #09090b */
--term-chrome: #0a0a0c;             /* top window bar */
--term-border: var(--dk-border-default);   /* rgba(255,255,255,.09) */
--term-border-hover: var(--dk-border-strong); /* .14 */
--term-divider: var(--dk-border-subtle);   /* .06, full-bleed hairlines */
--term-rail: 2px solid var(--cat);  /* left prompt channel */
--term-radius: 0.5rem;              /* 8px everywhere — tightest */
--term-text-label: var(--dk-text-faint);   /* #3f3f46 — labels pushed WAY back */
--term-text-data: var(--dk-text-secondary);/* #a1a1aa */
--term-text-title: var(--dk-text-primary); /* #fafafa */
--term-row-hover: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
--term-cursor-dur: 1.1s;            /* step-end blink, functional */
--term-ease: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
--term-dur: 150ms;
```

## C · NEON GLASS — scope `.proto-neon` / `[data-proto="c"]`
```css
--neon-surface: linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(28,28,32,.70) 0%, rgba(12,12,15,.85) 100%); /* top-lit glass */
--neon-blur: var(--dk-blur-md);     /* 24px — up from 12px */
--neon-border: var(--dk-border-default);
--neon-border-hover: var(--dk-border-strong);
--neon-elev: var(--dk-elev-2);
--neon-elev-hover: var(--dk-elev-3), 0 0 32px -8px var(--cat);
--neon-sheen: var(--dk-sheen);
--neon-radius-card: 0.75rem;        /* 12px */
--neon-radius-inner: 0.5rem;        /* 8px */
--neon-glow-opacity: .15;           /* static base — no pulse */
--neon-glow-opacity-hover: .35;     /* reactive */
--neon-icon-bg: var(--cat);         /* used at hex-alpha suffix: ${color}14 */
--neon-well-bg: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
--neon-text: var(--dk-text-primary);
--neon-text-dim: var(--dk-text-secondary);
--neon-ease: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
--neon-dur: 300ms;
```

