# Section 3 — Component Specs

## 3.1 WidgetCardA (SIGNAL) — exact replacement classes
Wrapper (keep `group relative overflow-hidden`, keep `SignalBar`, keep children wrapper):
```
rounded-xl border bg-[var(--sig-surface)] p-5
shadow-[var(--sig-elev)]
[box-shadow:var(--sig-elev),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,.05)]
hover:shadow-[var(--sig-elev-hover),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,.07)]
border-[var(--sig-border)] hover:border-[var(--sig-border-hover)]
transition-[box-shadow,border-color] duration-[180ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)]
hover:-translate-y-px
```
`SignalBar` upgrade (keep 2px height, keep full width — layout unchanged):
```tsx
// existing 2px bar: backgroundColor = cat, opacity 1.
// ADD directly beneath it (inside same absolute container, no layout shift):
<div style={{
  position: 'absolute', top: 2, left: 0, right: 0, height: 12,
  background: `linear-gradient(180deg, ${cat}1f 0%, transparent 100%)`,
  opacity: hovered ? 1 : 0.6, transition: 'opacity 180ms',
  pointerEvents: 'none',
}} />
```
Stat wells inside card: `rounded-lg bg-[#0d0d10] p-3 [box-shadow:var(--sig-well-shadow)] border border-white/[0.03]`.

## 3.2 WidgetCardB (TERMINAL) — exact replacement classes
Wrapper:
```
rounded-lg border border-[var(--term-border)] bg-[var(--term-surface)] text-zinc-100
shadow-none pl-[calc(1rem+2px)]  /* leaves room for left rail */
relative overflow-hidden
hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors duration-150
```
Left rail (add as first child, absolute — no layout change):
```tsx
<div style={{ position:'absolute', left:0, top:0, bottom:0, width:2, background: cat, opacity: .7 }} />
```
`TerminalLabel` fix — push labels back, break mono wall:
```
TerminalLabel: font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--term-text-label)]  /* #3f3f46 */
CardTitle (add where title exists): font-sans font-semibold text-[13px] text-[var(--term-text-title)] tracking-[-0.01em]
CardDescription: font-sans text-[12px] text-[var(--term-text-data)] leading-relaxed
Data values: font-mono text-[12px] tabular-nums text-[var(--term-text-title)]
```
`CardFooter`: `border-t border-[var(--term-divider)]` (full-bleed, keep p-4 pt-0). Dividers between sections: `border-[var(--term-divider)]` full width.
Buttons (motion(Button) unchanged): primary `rounded-lg border px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em]` with inline `borderColor: cat59, color: cat`, hover `backgroundColor: cat14`. Secondary: `border-white/[0.06] text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300`.

## 3.3 WidgetCardC (NEON) — exact replacement classes
Wrapper (fixes weak glass):
```
rounded-xl border border-[var(--neon-border)] p-5
bg-[var(--neon-surface)] backdrop-blur-[24px]
[box-shadow:var(--neon-elev),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,.06)]
transition-[box-shadow,border-color,transform] duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)]
hover:-translate-y-[2px] hover:border-[var(--cat)]/40
hover:shadow-[var(--dk-elev-3),0_0_32px_-8px_var(--cat)]
```
`NeonEdge` upgrade: height `1.5px`, gradient `linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, ${cat} 50%, transparent)`, add `+ 1px` inner sheen line below at `${cat}14`.
`NeonIconBox` (keep structure, strengthen):
```tsx
style={{
  backgroundColor: `${color}14`, border: `1px solid ${color}40`,
  boxShadow: `0 0 16px -4px ${color}55, inset 0 1px 0 ${color}25`,
  borderRadius: 8, width: 36, height: 36,
}}
// icon color: ${color}, opacity .95
```
Ambient glow — **replace the artificial pulse**:
```tsx
// remove: animate: { opacity: [0.2,0.4,0.2] }, duration:4, repeat:Infinity
// replace with pointer-reactive (L2):
const mx = useMotionValue(0.5), my = useMotionValue(0.4);
// on card onMouseMove: mx.set(e.clientX-rect.left), my.set(...)
<motion.div style={{
  position:'absolute', inset:0, pointerEvents:'none',
  background: useMotionTemplate`radial-gradient(320px circle at ${mx}px ${my}px, ${cat}26 0%, transparent 70%)`,
  filter: 'blur(24px)', opacity: reduce ? 0.12 : 0.15,
  animate: hovered ? { opacity: 0.35 } : { opacity: reduce ? 0.12 : 0.15 },
  transition: { duration: 0.4, ease: [0.16,1,0.3,1] },
}} />
// touch/no-pointer fallback: animate x between two positions, duration 12, ease 'easeInOut', repeat Infinity, repeatType 'mirror' — amplitude ±40px only.
```
Typography (max 2 fonts/view: Space Grotesk hero + Inter everything else; JetBrains Mono reserved for code-only views):
- Hero number/timer: `font-display font-bold text-[40px] tracking-[-0.02em] tabular-nums` + inline `textShadow: 0 0 24px ${cat}4d`.
- Titles: `font-sans font-semibold text-[13px]`.
- Labels/descriptions/data: `font-sans text-[11px|12px]` with `tabular-nums` on numeric values.

