## 3.5 TrackingScorePanel & ProductivityChart (structural-hook spec — paste these files for exact-class version)
**TrackingScorePanel** (assume: score number + circular progress + streak):
- A: ring `stroke={cat} strokeWidth={6}`, track `#ffffff14`, score `font-mono text-[32px] tabular`, streak flame solid `#fbbf24`.
- B: ring `strokeWidth={2} stroke={cat}99 strokeLinecap="butt"`, track `#ffffff0d`, score `font-mono text-[28px] tabular`, streak rendered as mono text `×3` in amber.
- C: ring `stroke={cat} strokeWidth={5} strokeLinecap="round"` + `filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px ${cat}99)`, score `font-display text-[32px] tracking-tight`, flame with `drop-shadow(0 0 8px #fbbf2480)`.

**ProductivityChart** (bars/line, canvas/SVG):
- Grid lines: `stroke rgba(255,255,255,.06)`; axis labels: `font-mono 10px fill #71717a` (all directions).
- Bars: A = solid fill `${cat}e6`, square top; B = fill `${cat}b3`, 1px gap between blocks (terminal pixels), square; C = fill `url(#grad)` gradient `${cat}f0`→`${cat}40` + top glow cap line `${cat}` 1.5px with blur.
- Tooltip (all): `bg var(--dk-bg-surface) backdrop-blur-md border border-[var(--dk-border-strong)] shadow-[var(--dk-elev-3)] rounded-lg p-2 font-mono text-[11px]`.

## 3.6 CardEntrance — keep BlurFade, tune per direction
```tsx
// A: delay={reduce?0:0.05*index} duration={reduce?0:0.25}  (unchanged)
// B: delay={reduce?0:0.04*index} duration={reduce?0:0.20}  (snappier)
// C: delay={reduce?0:0.06*index} duration={reduce?0:0.35}  (cinematic)
```
No other entrance motion. Do not add initial y/scale inside BlurFade (double-animation anti-pattern).

