# Section 4 — Motion & Animation Specs

| | A · SIGNAL (L1) | B · TERMINAL (L1+) | C · NEON (L2) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Hover transform | `y: -1` | none (color/bg only) | `y: -2` (matches DeskFlowCard hoverLift) |
| Hover shadow | elev-1→elev-2 | none | elev-2→elev-3 + colored 32px glow |
| Hover border | zinc-800/60→zinc-700/60 | white .09→.14 + row bg .04 | white .09→`cat`40 |
| Active/press | scale .985, 120ms | scale .98 (buttons only) | scale .97, 150ms |
| Focus-visible | `outline: 2px solid #06b6d4; outline-offset: 2px` (all directions, identical) | same | same |
| Entrance | BlurFade 0.05i / 0.25s | BlurFade 0.04i / 0.20s | BlurFade 0.06i / 0.35s |
| Ambient | none | cursor blink 1.1s step-end | pointer-reactive glow; touch fallback 12s ±40px drift, opacity ±.03 |
| Ease (all) | `[0.16,1,0.3,1]` — no spring/bounce anywhere | same | same |
| Reduced motion | entrance 0ms, hover instant color, no translate | cursor static solid, no blink | glow static opacity .12, no pointer-follow, no drift |

motion/react configs:
```ts
const EASE = [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] as const;
// A hover: transition={{ duration: 0.18, ease: EASE }}
// B hover: transition={{ duration: 0.15, ease: EASE }}  (color only)
// C hover: transition={{ duration: 0.30, ease: EASE }}; glow: { duration: 0.4, ease: EASE }
// C touch drift: { duration: 12, ease: 'easeInOut', repeat: Infinity, repeatType: 'mirror' } — killed when reduce=true
```

