# Section 5 — State Visuals

**Empty** (invitation, not dead end):
- A: recessed well centered, mono 11px `NO SIGNAL` text-muted + a thin animated? no — static dashed 1px line in cat at 30%. CTA button solid cat.
- B: centered mono 11px uppercase `— no data —` text-faint + blinking cursor; CTA as terminal-style button.
- C: glass well, Inter 12px text-secondary + icon in NeonIconBox (cat14 bg); CTA glass primary.

**Loading** (skeleton):
- A: solid blocks `#141417` with a slow top-sheen sweep (1px highlight line translates x over 1.4s, ease-in-out, repeat) — no pulse.
- B: mono placeholder glyph blocks `▒▒▒▒` text-faint + a 1px vertical scan line moving left→right (linear, 1.6s, repeat).
- C: glass blocks `bg-white/[0.04]` with soft shimmer gradient translating x (1.8s). All killed under reduced motion (static blocks).

**Error**:
- All: border/rail turns `#ef4444` (--dk-danger). A: solid 2px top bar danger + icon. B: mono line `! ERR:` text danger + muted traceback line below. C: danger-tinted glass + red glow shadow. Keep existing `border-rose-500/20` but upgrade to above.

**Populated**: primary state — specs in Section 3.

**Drag feedback** (all directions): dragged card = `ring-2 ring-[var(--cat)]` + elev-4 + opacity .92; sibling cards = opacity .55 `transition-opacity 200ms`.

