# Section 6 — Anti-Slop Verification (12 items × 3)

| # | Rule | A | B | C |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Tokens only, no hardcoded hex except CATEGORY_ACCENT | PASS (hex only in cat alpha suffixes `cat1f`, matches existing code pattern) | PASS | PASS |
| 2 | Max rounded-xl, p-5 | PASS (12px card, p-5) | PASS (8px max) | PASS |
| 3 | Dark mode only | PASS | PASS | PASS |
| 4 | Inter/Space Grotesk/JetBrains Mono, max 2/view | PASS (Inter+mono) | PASS (Inter+mono) | PASS (Space Grotesk hero + Inter; mono reserved for code views) |
| 5 | Glass layer where applicable | PASS (N/A — solid direction, explicitly no glass) | PASS (N/A — flat) | PASS (`bg` gradient + `backdrop-blur-[24px]`, stronger than old /40) |
| 6 | No glass on chrome/shell | PASS (widget surfaces only) | PASS | PASS |
| 7 | One signal hue per surface | PASS (only SignalBar) | PASS (only rail+prompt) | PASS (edge+glow+icon, same hue) |
| 8 | Radii ∈ {8,12,pill} | PASS | PASS | PASS (chart bar micro-corners exempt, noted) |
| 9 | prefers-reduced-motion via useReducedMotion | PASS | PASS (cursor static) | PASS (glow static, no follow/drift) |
| 10 | No decorative glow/gradients | PASS (bar-bleed = signal identity) | PASS (none) | PASS (glow = category signal + pointer feedback, functional) |
| 11 | No spring/bounce; ease [0.16,1,0.3,1] | PASS | PASS | PASS (touch drift uses easeInOut, amplitude ±40px — no bounce) |
| 12 | Typography hierarchy | PASS (mono readout / Inter body) | PASS (3-tier contrast breaks mono wall) | PASS (Space Grotesk hero / Inter body) |

